,"options":{"A":"0","B":"1","C":"2","D":"3"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/mechanics/truss","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"mechanics","topic":"truss"},{"id":"113-1-19","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":19,"answer":"C","excerpt":"此桁架中cg桿件所受之內力為多少kN？","options":{"A":"21.25 拉力","B":"27.25 拉力","C":"31.25 拉力","D":"37.25 拉力"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/mechanics/truss","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"mechanics","topic":"truss"},{"id":"113-1-20","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":20,"answer":"D","excerpt":"於設計此桁架時，桿件斷面僅能選取圖中之斷面甲或斷面乙，斷面甲與乙之斷面積A分別 為 10 cm2與 20 cm2，材料彈性係數 E 皆為 70 GPa，若欲使桁架所有桿件之拉及壓的軸向 應變絕對值皆小於0.001，則需採用斷面乙之桿件的最少數目為何？","options":{"A":"2","B":"3","C":"4","D":"5"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/mechanics/stress-strain","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"mechanics","topic":"stress-strain"},{"id":"113-1-21","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":21,"answer":"B","excerpt":"如圖 ( 十五 ) 所示，甲圖、乙圖、丙圖及丁圖等四筆材料試驗測定值之分佈情形，分別以 線形圖表示，圖中「o」為測定值，T 表示為標準值 ( 真值 )。若以精密度 ( precision ) 及精準度(accuracy)表示材料試驗測定值之準確程度，下列何者敘述正確？ 圖(十五)","options":{"A":"甲圖精密度良好","B":"乙圖精密度良好","C":"丙圖精準度不佳","D":"丁圖精準度不佳"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/113/professional-1-q21.webp","originalPage":6,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/basic-properties","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"basic-properties"},{"id":"113-1-22","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":22,"answer":"D","excerpt":"「閃凝」與「假凝」為卜特蘭水泥在加水後之凝結過程中，可能發生兩種異常凝結現象， 下列敘述何者不正確？","options":{"A":"閃凝現象發生原因主要為水泥內鋁酸三鈣含量過高及添加之石膏含量不足","B":"發生閃凝現象會降低水泥漿體的硬固強度","C":"假凝現象發生原因主要為添加入水泥熟料之石膏脫水，凝結過程石膏再結晶所引致","D":"發生假凝現象時，水泥漿體會產生過多水化熱"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/cement-vicat","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"cement-vicat"},{"id":"113-1-23","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":23,"answer":"D","excerpt":"下列何者試驗屬於材料耐久性試驗？","options":{"A":"凝結時間試驗","B":"針入度試驗","C":"軟化點試驗","D":"硫酸鈉試驗"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/basic-properties","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"basic-properties"},{"id":"113-1-24","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":24,"answer":"B","excerpt":"已知烘乾(O.D.)輕質細粒料之吸水率為10.0%，將1000.0g烘乾輕質細粒料與180.0g自來水 充份混合後，輕質細粒料內部孔隙均充滿水分，且自來水均無散失吸附於輕質細粒料 內外，使輕質細粒料呈現濕潤狀態，則此時輕質細粒料表面含水率之計算值為何？","options":{"A":"6.78 %","B":"7.27 %","C":"8.00 %","D":"16.36 % -6- m 3 m 3"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/wood","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"wood"},{"id":"113-1-25","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":25,"answer":"A","excerpt":"在混凝土配比設計時，為增加混凝土強度及耐久性，擬額外添加卜特蘭水泥質量 25 % 之 高爐石粉，設計水膠比 ( W / B ) 為 0.4。假如每 m 3新拌混凝土之拌和水質量為 175.0 kg， 則每m3新拌混凝土所需之高爐石粉質量為何？","options":{"A":"87.50 kg","B":"109.38 kg","C":"145.83 kg","D":"262.50 kg"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/cement-types","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"cement-types"},{"id":"113-1-26","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":26,"answer":"C","excerpt":"在新拌混凝土中添加輸氣劑具有許多功能與影響，下列敘述何者不正確？","options":{"A":"減低硬固混凝土強度","B":"增加新拌混凝土工作性","C":"減低硬固混凝土水密性","D":"增加硬固混凝土抵抗凍融環境造成損傷之能力"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/concrete","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"concrete"},{"id":"113-1-27","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":27,"answer":"C","excerpt":"取某堆烘乾 ( O . D .) 細粒料若干克 ( g ) 進行篩分析試驗，試驗記錄如表 ( 一 ) 所示，求得 篩分析結果之烘乾細粒料細度模數 ( F . M .) 為 2.6，則停留在 No . 100 號篩之烘乾細粒料 質量X應為何？","options":{"A":"80.77 g 篩號 篩孔尺寸(mm) 各篩停留質量(g)","B":"100.00 g No.4 4.75 0","C":"131.25 g No.8 2.38 60","D":"153.85 g No.16 1.18 80 No.30 0.60 110 No.50 0.30 150 No.100 0.15 X 表(一) No.200 0.075 0"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/basic-properties","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"basic-properties"},{"id":"113-1-28","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":28,"answer":"A","excerpt":"下列何者圖形最為可能是常用木材縱向抗壓試驗載重–變形曲線？ 載 載 載 載","options":{"A":"（詳見原題附圖選項 A）","B":"（詳見原題附圖選項 B）","C":"（詳見原題附圖選項 C）","D":"重 重 重 重 變形 變形 變形 變形"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/113-1-28.png","sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/cement-strength","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"cement-strength"},{"id":"113-1-29","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":29,"answer":"C","excerpt":"通常所稱的木材主要取自具有一定直徑和高度喬木樹幹之哪一組織？","options":{"A":"樹皮","B":"形成層","C":"木質部","D":"韌皮部"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/wood","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"wood"},{"id":"113-1-30","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":30,"answer":"B","excerpt":"木材時常作為混凝土模板。梁、版構件模板組立時，通常設有垂直支撐系統，使模板 保持穩固。為了施工安全及避免模板支撐倒塌事件，下列何者無法增強模板支撐系統 之穩定性？","options":{"A":"支撐系統之底部支承應考慮地面狀況，保持穩固","B":"為能自動調整支撐，放鬆結合器後，隨即澆置混凝土","C":"同一支撐避免兩處以上搭接","D":"支撐每高 2 m 設置水平繫條"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/concrete","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"concrete"},{"id":"113-1-31","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":31,"answer":"C","excerpt":"工地常用的一體成型塑造之紐澤西護欄，其塑膠材質主要為：","options":{"A":"聚四氟乙烯 ( PTFE )","B":"聚氯乙烯 ( PVC )","C":"聚乙烯 ( PE )","D":"聚苯乙烯 ( PS )"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/polymers-asphalt","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"polymers-asphalt"},{"id":"113-1-32","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":32,"answer":"D","excerpt":"油漆稀釋劑中，松香水、甲苯、香蕉水共同成分之一為甲苯。甲苯易燃，且對人體有害。 此三種稀釋劑所含甲苯量之比較，下列何者正確？","options":{"A":"松香水＞香蕉水＞甲苯","B":"甲苯＞松香水＞香蕉水","C":"香蕉水＞松香水＞甲苯","D":"甲苯＞香蕉水＞松香水 - 7-"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/basic-properties","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"basic-properties"},{"id":"113-1-33","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":33,"answer":"C","excerpt":"淡江大橋位於淡水河口，採用的混凝土需要特別設計與考量，用於混凝土組成材料中的 水泥與粗細粒料原料源於不同類型之沉積岩，下列敘述何者正確？","options":{"A":"頁岩是臺灣混凝土工程最普遍使用的粗細粒料原料、砂岩為製造水泥的主要原料","B":"頁岩是臺灣混凝土工程最普遍使用的粗細粒料原料、石灰岩為製造水泥的主要原料","C":"砂岩是臺灣混凝土工程最普遍使用的粗細粒料原料、石灰岩為製造水泥的主要原料","D":"砂岩是臺灣混凝土工程最普遍使用的粗細粒料原料、凝灰岩為製造水泥的主要原料"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/cement-types","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"cement-types"},{"id":"113-1-34","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":34,"answer":"A","excerpt":"淡江大橋會使用到耐震鋼材，對不同系列鋼材之降伏強度上下限、衝擊值，以及合金成分 等都有嚴格規範，最能落實「強柱弱梁」的設計要求。若採用建築結構用鋼材(SN系列)， 則規定降伏比(指降伏強度與抗拉強度之比值)必須小於多少？","options":{"A":"0.80","B":"0.85","C":"0.90","D":"0.95"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/metals","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"metals"},{"id":"113-1-35","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":35,"answer":"D","excerpt":"淡江大橋臨近出海口，設施容易遭受海風與氯離子侵蝕，造成金屬腐蝕等問題，關於 金屬防腐蝕方式，下列敘述何者完全正確？ ①不銹鋼的英文原名為Stainless，較貼切的名詞翻譯應為「少銹鋼」或「弱銹鋼」 ②不銹鋼是碳鋼中加入第一合金元素「鉻」，但是「鉻」含量應適量不可過高，含量宜 低於 11%以下 ③耐候性鋼主要是產生一層銹層來防止繼續腐蝕，達到耐蝕效果 ④不銹鋼材料是因其表面可生成一層氧化鐵薄膜，使材料能達到防腐蝕效果","options":{"A":"① ②","B":"② ③","C":"③ ④","D":"① ③"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/metals","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"metals"},{"id":"113-1-36","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":36,"answer":"A","excerpt":"淡江大橋於設計階段，有詳細考量可符合碳盤查與節能減碳的目標。關於卜特蘭水泥環保 標章的敘述，下列敘述何者完全正確？ ①鼓勵業者使用再生材料，符合銀級環保水泥標章，產品回收料各月摻配重量百分比均 達10%以上 ②鼓勵業者使用再生材料，符合金級環保水泥標章，產品回收料各月摻配重量百分比均 達 12 % 以上 ③回收料規定必須是國內產出，以解決國內污染為主 ④政府的公共工程必須優先採購有環保標章的水泥 ⑤國內業者的回收料使用比率通常在20~30%，某些業者可達50%","options":{"A":"① ③ ④","B":"① ② ⑤","C":"② ③ ④","D":"③ ④ ⑤"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/cement-types","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"cement-types"},{"id":"113-1-37","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":37,"answer":"D","excerpt":"淡江大橋如採用綠混凝土G類(一般型)，卜作嵐材料應佔總膠結材料之多少以上？","options":{"A":"10 %","B":"20 %","C":"30 %","D":"40 %  -8-"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/concrete","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"concrete"},{"id":"113-1-38","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":38,"answer":"B","excerpt":"鄰近淡江大橋的紅毛城，部分區域須進行修補工程，修補過程需使用磚材。關於普通磚 的比重與品質，下列敘述何者不正確？","options":{"A":"磚磨粉後測得之真比重變化於 2.4 ~ 2.7 之間","B":"黏板岩為原料製成的磚鬆比重會低於黏土為原料者","C":"燒磚時煅燒溫度越高，所得之磚鬆比重越重","D":"依 CNS 382 規定，普通磚依品質區分為 1 種磚、2 種磚、3 種磚"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/stone-ceramics-glass","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"stone-ceramics-glass"},{"id":"113-1-39","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":39,"answer":"B","excerpt":"粗粒料比重試驗如圖(十六)所示，將質量2200.0g之面乾內飽和(S.S.D.)粗粒料(如甲圖 所示)，放入某容器中，加水至高度h(如乙圖所示)，測得(容器+水+S.S.D.粗粒料)之 質量為4000.0g，將S.S.D.粗粒料由容器中取出後，將容器加水至相同高度h( 如丙圖所 示)，測得(容器+水)之質量為2600.0g，再將2200.0g之S.S.D.粗粒料處理成烘乾(O.D.) 狀態後，測得重量減少104.0g，則此堆粗粒料在烘乾(O.D.)狀態之比重為何？","options":{"A":"1.50","B":"2.62","C":"2.75","D":"3.25 圖(十六)"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/113/professional-1-q39.webp","originalPage":9,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/basic-properties","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"basic-properties"},{"id":"113-1-40","year":113,"exam":"professional-1","subjectName":"專業科目（一）","questionNo":40,"answer":"C","excerpt":"瀝青材料具有防水、防潮等性能，常被使用於屋頂、地下室、蓄水池等之防水層，此種 施工法稱為「瀝青油毛氈防水工法」。有關油毛氈與工法敘述，下列選項何者正確？ ①鋪貼時，油毛氈必須拼接，且四邊不可重疊，以免厚度不一致 ②油毛氈存放時必須平放，以免油毛氈因自重而產生變形 ③採澆流式鋪貼法，先鋪好油毛氈，其上澆流熱熔之流體瀝青 ④油毛氈施工完成後，隔日立即以隔熱磚、泡沫混凝土等壓覆其上，以作為保護與防熱 層之作用","options":{"A":"全部正確，無錯誤敘述","B":"僅有 1 個錯誤，有 3 個正確","C":"有 3 個錯誤，僅有 1 個正確","D":"全部錯誤，無正確敘述"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"sourceLabel":"113 年統測試題","lessonRoute":"/subjects/materials/concrete","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/113_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTEzLTR5LTA2LTEucGRm","subject":"materials","topic":"concrete"}]}
